WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.405 --> 00:00:03.355
Another interesting thing that happened this weekend as a result of

00:00:03.355 --> 00:00:06.425
Donald Trump's little Twitter tirade

00:00:06.425 --> 00:00:09.205
is that we had National Intelligence officials

00:00:09.205 --> 00:00:12.525
who were meeting overseas to discuss

00:00:12.935 --> 00:00:16.115
the Russian interference who had to tell them

00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:19.105
"Hey, please disregard what The President is tweeting,

00:00:19.105 --> 00:00:21.655
we're going to take this issue seriously,

00:00:21.655 --> 00:00:24.815
we're going to do something about it."

00:00:24.815 --> 00:00:27.925
Because based on what Donald Trump was sending out Saturday morning

00:00:27.925 --> 00:00:31.225
everybody pretty much got the impression that he doesn't care.

00:00:31.235 --> 00:00:34.275
All he wants to do is shift blame.

00:00:34.275 --> 00:00:37.325
He wants to say "this was Obama", "This guy did this, the guy before me

00:00:37.325 --> 00:00:40.345
so now he's gone, so now we've got nothing to worry about"

00:00:40.345 --> 00:00:41.495
Well, no. The intelligence community

00:00:42.255 --> 00:00:45.265
has been warning us for quite some time now

00:00:45.265 --> 00:00:48.345
that Russian could try to interfere

00:00:48.345 --> 00:00:51.355
in the 2018 midterm elections.

00:00:51.355 --> 00:00:54.255
One of the main reasons we kind of wanted those sanctions

00:00:54.255 --> 00:00:56.825
just to let them know that they're not going to get away with it.

00:00:57.315 --> 00:01:00.685
Trump's not doing anything about it, doesn't

00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:03.905
seem to care, doesn't really mind

00:01:03.905 --> 00:01:05.285
that Russians might interfere again. Why?

00:01:05.755 --> 00:01:09.245
Because it's going to be to the benefit of Republicans.

00:01:09.295 --> 00:01:12.315
I mean, I think it's hilarious

00:01:12.315 --> 00:01:15.505
that he's out there, trying to say that Obama was

00:01:16.015 --> 00:01:19.015
covering it up. Or, that they interfered

00:01:19.015 --> 00:01:21.895
on behalf of Hillary Clinton

00:01:21.895 --> 00:01:24.575
because, according to Trump and some of the hardcore MAGA crowd

00:01:24.575 --> 00:01:27.615
The Russians wanted Hillary Clinton to win, it just didn't

00:01:27.615 --> 00:01:30.665
go their way. So, "even with Russian interference

00:01:30.665 --> 00:01:33.505
she still managed to lose the election" is one of the

00:01:33.505 --> 00:01:36.625
talking points that we've got going around right now. But look,

00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:39.755
all of this underscores the biggest problem there is -

00:01:39.755 --> 00:01:40.755
The Russians interfered.

00:01:41.255 --> 00:01:44.075
Maybe it was sanctioned

00:01:44.075 --> 00:01:47.075
by the Russian government. The jury is still out on that.

00:01:47.075 --> 00:01:49.715
But regardless, something has to happen

00:01:49.715 --> 00:01:51.675
and one of the biggest things that has to happen

00:01:51.915 --> 00:01:54.795
is on us. It's on Americans.

00:01:54.795 --> 00:01:57.375
We have to learn to differentiate

00:01:57.375 --> 00:01:58.565
between fake news, propaganda

00:01:59.155 --> 00:02:01.125
and real, honest reporting.

00:02:01.735 --> 00:02:04.425
Because they can throw all the propaganda

00:02:04.425 --> 00:02:06.005
that they want at us

00:02:06.675 --> 00:02:09.595
and if we're dumb enough to believe it

00:02:09.595 --> 00:02:12.595
then they succeed. You know, recently

00:02:12.925 --> 00:02:15.995
there was this organization

00:02:16.525 --> 00:02:19.485
that had come up with, essentially, a standardized test of sorts.

00:02:19.485 --> 00:02:22.605
And they were going around the country, and they said "this will help

00:02:22.605 --> 00:02:25.055
teach high-school students how to differentiate

00:02:25.055 --> 00:02:28.285
between fake news and honest reporting".

00:02:28.285 --> 00:02:30.465
Countries like Great Britain decided to implement it

00:02:30.465 --> 00:02:33.405
so they can start teaching young high-school students

00:02:33.405 --> 00:02:35.885
how to differentiate between

00:02:35.885 --> 00:02:38.965
the two. Other countries have also adopted this. The US

00:02:38.965 --> 00:02:41.765
declined. They didn't want to be a part of this, you know,

00:02:41.765 --> 00:02:44.115
testing, or curriculum

00:02:44.135 --> 00:02:46.395
to teach our children how to

00:02:46.785 --> 00:02:50.225
tell the difference between

00:02:50.435 --> 00:02:52.815
journalism and fake news propaganda.

00:02:53.185 --> 00:02:56.105
And why could that be? Well,

00:02:56.105 --> 00:02:58.685
because an uninformed electorate,

00:02:58.685 --> 00:03:01.765
people who cannot tell the difference between fiction and reality,

00:03:01.765 --> 00:03:04.535
benefits the Republicans. We have already

00:03:04.535 --> 00:03:07.885
seen, in the last few weeks, study after study

00:03:07.885 --> 00:03:10.705
come out, saying that Donald Trump supporters

00:03:10.705 --> 00:03:12.245
were far more likely

00:03:12.245 --> 00:03:15.245
to share these fake news stories, to share

00:03:15.245 --> 00:03:18.305
these propaganda memes on social media

00:03:18.305 --> 00:03:20.495
than Democrats or Progressives.

00:03:20.865 --> 00:03:22.165
It works.

00:03:22.975 --> 00:03:25.735
The fake news being pushed

00:03:25.735 --> 00:03:28.655
out there, the hashtags, all of the propaganda

00:03:28.695 --> 00:03:31.895
worked on this particular group of people.

00:03:32.335 --> 00:03:35.235
And our government doesn't want to teach them

00:03:35.235 --> 00:03:38.265
the difference because they're the ones

00:03:38.265 --> 00:03:40.105
who benefited from it.

00:03:40.455 --> 00:03:43.575
So that's where we are right now with the  Mueller investigation.

00:03:43.575 --> 00:03:46.605
We have a lot of question marks

00:03:46.605 --> 00:03:49.555
we're getting a lot more answers and according to

00:03:49.555 --> 00:03:52.465
James Clapper, Fmr. Director of National Intelligence for the US,

00:03:52.645 --> 00:03:55.615
the big shoe

00:03:55.615 --> 00:03:58.385
is probably still yet to drop.

00:03:58.385 --> 00:04:01.085
Recently, in an interview, James Clapper

00:04:01.085 --> 00:04:03.435
said that he believes that Robert Mueller

00:04:03.435 --> 00:04:06.355
is most likely going after Donald Trump's personal

00:04:06.355 --> 00:04:09.205
and professional finances and when he finds

00:04:09.205 --> 00:04:11.665
whatever it is he's looking for,

00:04:11.665 --> 00:04:14.585
that is going to be the next big shoe to drop

00:04:14.585 --> 00:04:17.615
in this investigation. Now, Clapper

00:04:17.615 --> 00:04:20.655
admitted that he's not a part of then investigation and that proclamation,

00:04:20.655 --> 00:04:23.595
I guess, was pure speculation;

00:04:23.595 --> 00:04:26.685
He doesn't know for sure what they're going after.

00:04:26.685 --> 00:04:27.685
But he does know

00:04:28.045 --> 00:04:30.825
that Robert Mueller knows more about this investigation than

00:04:30.825 --> 00:04:33.385
anyone else. He does know

00:04:33.815 --> 00:04:36.905
that European banks

00:04:36.955 --> 00:04:39.625
have been subpoenaed for records regarding Donald Trump's

00:04:39.625 --> 00:04:42.785
personal finances, professional finances.

00:04:42.785 --> 00:04:45.785
So, it does seem likely, based on the available

00:04:45.785 --> 00:04:48.445
evidence, that Clapper could be 100%

00:04:48.445 --> 00:04:51.195
correct - the next big shoe, after

00:04:51.195 --> 00:04:54.545
this indictment of Friday that we just had -

00:04:54.545 --> 00:04:57.845
could be the finances of Donald Trump himself

00:04:57.845 --> 00:05:00.845
and his businesses. Because, as we know, and we'll talk

00:05:00.845 --> 00:05:03.955
about this more after the break, Jared Kushner's

00:05:03.955 --> 00:05:06.925
finances, right now, are suddenly

00:05:06.925 --> 00:05:10.125
in the spot light and that's not going to end well for anybody.

00:05:10.125 --> 00:05:12.835
